### What steps will reproduce the bug?

The following code reproduces the bug:
```typescript
import { connect, createServer } from "net";
import { Duplex } from "stream";

const server = createServer();

server.on("connection", (socket) => {
    socket.end();
});

server.listen(8444, () => {
